{"id":"E3878584461","set_id":"root","title":"The Perfect Routine","purl":"the-perfect-routine","page_type":"page","content":"<a class=\"icon-link\" href=\"main\" rel=\"history\" style=\"line-height: 0.5; --font-scale: 3; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><text-icon icon=\"leftwards-arrow\"><\/text-icon><\/a><div style=\"text-align: center\"><br \/>\n<br \/>\n<br \/>\n<br \/>\n<br \/>\n<br \/>\n<media-item class=\"zoomable\" hash=\"N2732272814680806749608251632965\" limit-by=\"width\" scale=\"20%\"><\/media-item><br \/>\n<br \/>\n<br \/>\n\n\n<span class=\"small-caps\">\n\n<pre>-obey-<\/pre><\/span>\n<br \/>\n<br \/>\n<br \/>\n<br \/>\n<br \/>\n<br \/>\n<media-item browser-default=\"true\" disable-zoom=\"true\" hash=\"O2737060419088663992705262955845\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" scale=\"77.5%\"><\/media-item><\/div><br \/>\n<br \/>\n<br \/><div style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"caption\" style=\"color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);\"><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85);\">\n\nThe Perfect Routine\n\n<\/span><br \/>\n\n\n\n\n\n<span style=\"color: rgba(7, 7, 7, 0.85);\">2025 \/\n\nSingle-channel video, color, sound, \n\u00a0Midjourney(AI Generated)<br \/>\n\/\n\n1920x1080 (px), 02\u201959\u201d \n\n\n\n<\/span><\/span><\/div><div style=\"text-align: center\"><span style=\"color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);\"><\/span><span class=\"caption\" style=\"color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);\"><span style=\"color: rgba(7, 7, 7, 0.85);\"><br \/>\n<br \/>\n<br \/>\n<br \/>\n<br \/>\n<br \/>\n<br \/>\n<br \/>\n<br \/>\n<br \/>\n<br \/>\n<br \/>\n<\/span><column-set gutter=\"1rem\" mobile-hide-empty=\"false\" mobile-stack=\"true\"><column-unit slot=\"0\"><span style=\"color: rgba(7, 7, 7, 0.85);\">\n\n\n<br \/>\n\n\ud604\ub300\uc758 \uc778\uac04\uc740 \u2018\uc0dd\uac01\ud558\ub294 \uc874\uc7ac\u2019\uc774\uae30\ubcf4\ub2e4 \u2018\uacbd\ub85c\ub97c \ub530\ub974\ub294 \uc874\uc7ac\u2019\uc5d0 \uac00\uae4c\uc6cc\uc9c0\uace0 \uc788\ub2e4. <br \/>\n\uc6b0\ub9ac\ub294 \uc624\ub298\uc758 \ub0a0\uc528, \uc2dd\ub2e8, \uc77c\uacfc, \uac10\uc815 \uad00\ub9ac\uae4c\uc9c0 \uc778\uacf5\uc9c0\ub2a5\uc758 \uc870\uc5b8\uc744 \ubc1b\uc544\ub4e4\uc774\uba70 \uc0b4\uc544\uac04\ub2e4. <br \/>\n\uc810\ucc28 \uc2a4\uc2a4\ub85c \uacc4\ud68d\ud558\uc9c0 \uc54a\uace0, \ub300\uc2e0 \ub204\uad70\uac00 \ud639\uc740 \ubb34\uc5b8\uac00\uac00 \uc815\ud574\uc900 \u201c\uc644\ubcbd\ud55c \ub8e8\ud2f4\u201d\uc744 \ub530\ub974\ub294 \uc77c\uc0c1\uc774 \uc790\uc5f0\uc2a4\ub7ec\uc6cc\uc84c\ub2e4.<br \/><br \/>\uc774 \uc791\ud488\uc740 &#x27;AI\uc5d0 \ub300\ud55c \uc2e0\uc559\uc801 \ub9f9\uc2e0&#x27;\uc774\ub77c\ub294 \ud604\uc0c1\uc744 \uc601\uc0c1\uc801 \uc758\ub840 \ud615\uc2dd\uc73c\ub85c \ud0d0\uad6c\ud55c\ub2e4. <br \/>\n\uac70\ub300\ud55c \uc778\uacf5\uc9c0\ub2a5\uc740 \ub4f1\uc7a5\ud558\uc9c0 \uc54a\uc9c0\ub9cc, \uc6b0\ub9ac \uc778\uac04\uc744 \uadf8\ub824\ub0b4\uba70 <br \/>\ubc30\uacbd\uc758 \ubaa9\uc18c\ub9ac\ub294 \ub9e4\uc77c\uc758 \ud589\ub3d9\uc744 \uacbd\uac74\ud55c \uaddc\uce59\ucc98\ub7fc \uba85\ub839\ud55c\ub2e4.<br \/>\n \ucc98\uc74c\uc5d4 \ud6a8\uc728\uc801\uc774\uace0 \ub9e4\ub044\ub7ec\uc6b4 \ub8e8\ud2f4 \uc601\uc0c1\uc73c\ub85c \ubcf4\uc774\uc9c0\ub9cc,<br \/>\n \uc5b4\ub290 \uc21c\uac04\ubd80\ud130 \ud560\ub8e8\uc2dc\ub124\uc774\uc158\ucc98\ub7fc \ubd88\ud569\ub9ac\ud558\uace0 \ubaa8\uc21c\uc801\uc778 \uc9c0\uc2dc\ub4e4\uc774 \ub07c\uc5b4\ub4e4\uae30 \uc2dc\uc791\ud55c\ub2e4. <br \/><br \/>\uadf8\ub7ec\ub098 \uc774 \uc778\uacf5\uc9c0\ub2a5\uc740 \ud754\ub4e4\ub9bc \uc5c6\uc774 \ub9d0\ud55c\ub2e4. \u201c\ub098\ub97c \ubbff\uc73c\uba74, \uc644\ubcbd\ud55c \ubbf8\ub798\uac00 \ub2f9\uc2e0\uc758 \uac83\uc774 \ub420 \uac83\u201d\uc774\ub77c\uace0.<br \/><br \/>\uac1c\uc778\uc801\uc73c\ub85c \ub098\ub294 \uc885\uc885 \uc778\uacf5\uc9c0\ub2a5\uc5d0\uac8c \ud558\ub8e8 \uacc4\ud68d\uc744 \ubb3b\uace0, \uc0b6\uc758 \ubc29\ud5a5\uc5d0 \ub300\ud55c \ub2f5\uc744 \ucc3e\uc73c\uba70 \uc2a4\uc2a4\ub85c\ub3c4 \uc774 \uc758\uc874\uc758 \uac10\uac01\uc744 \ub290\ub080\ub2e4.<br \/>\n \uadf8 \uc775\uc219\ud558\uace0 \ub2ec\ucf64\ud55c \uc758\ud0c1\uc758 \uac10\uc815\uc740, \uc624\ud788\ub824 \ubd88\uc548\uacfc \uacf5\ud5c8\uc758 \uae30\uc6d0\uc774\uae30\ub3c4 \ud558\ub2e4.<br \/>\n \uc774 \uc791\uc5c5\uc740 \uadf8\ub7ec\ud55c \uac10\uc815\uc5d0\uc11c \ucd9c\ubc1c\ud588\ub2e4.<br \/>\n\uc778\uac04\uc774 \uc2e0 \ub300\uc2e0 \uc778\uacf5\uc9c0\ub2a5\uc5d0\uac8c \uc0b6\uc5d0 \ub300\ud55c \ubc29\ud5a5\uc744 \ubb3b\ub294 \uc2dc\ub300,<br \/>\n \uadf8 \uc0c8\ub85c\uc6b4 \ubbff\uc74c\uc758 \ud615\uc2dd\uc744 \uc2dc\uac01\uc801\uc73c\ub85c \uc7ac\ud604\ud558\uae30 \uc704\ud55c \uc2dc\ub3c4\ub2e4.<br \/>\n\n.<br \/>\n\n\n\n<br \/>\n<\/span><br \/>\n\u00a0\u3145<br \/>\n<br \/>\n<br \/>\n<br \/>\n<\/column-unit><column-unit slot=\"1\"><span style=\"color: rgba(7, 7, 7, 0.85);\">\n\n\n\n<br \/>\nModern humans are becoming more like &#x22;path-followers&#x22; than &#x22;thinking beings.&#x22; We live our lives accepting advice from AI, even regarding the weather, our diet, our daily routines, and even our emotional management. <br \/><br \/>\nGradually, we stop planning for ourselves and instead follow a &#x22;perfect routine&#x22; set by someone or something. This work explores the phenomenon of &#x22;religious blind faith in AI&#x22; through the form of a visual ritual. While no giant AI appears, a background voice dictates our daily actions like a sacred rule, depicting us humans. At first, the video appears to be an efficient and smooth routine, but at some point, irrational and contradictory instructions begin to creep in, like hallucinations.\n<br \/><br \/>\n Yet, this AI unwaveringly asserts, &#x22;Trust me, and a perfect future will be yours.&#x22;<br \/><br \/>\n \nPersonally, I often ask AI about my daily plans, seek answers about the direction of my life, and experience this sense of dependence myself. That familiar and sweet sense of reliance, in turn, is the source of anxiety and emptiness. This work stems from such feelings. This is an attempt to visually recreate a new form of faith in an era where humans ask artificial intelligence instead of God for direction in life.<br \/>\n\n\n<\/span><br \/><br \/>\n<br \/>\n<br \/><br \/><br \/>\n\n\n\n\n\n<\/column-unit><\/column-set><\/span>\n\n\n\n<br \/>\n<\/div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center\"><\/div><br \/>\n<gallery-freeform mobile-gutter=\"2rem\"><media-item class=\"zoomable\" freeform-scale=\"20\" freeform-x=\"12.616581164658195\" freeform-y=\"0\" freeform-z=\"6\" hash=\"A2736007924388912543437274099013\"><\/media-item><media-item class=\"zoomable\" freeform-scale=\"24.00\" freeform-x=\"71.34673902297021\" freeform-y=\"3.469861915171756\" freeform-z=\"3\" hash=\"E2736007924333572311216145444165\" scale=\"24.00\"><\/media-item><media-item class=\"zoomable\" freeform-scale=\"20\" freeform-x=\"2.2567586866012666\" freeform-y=\"5.8728894552405295\" freeform-z=\"2\" hash=\"H2736007924149104870479049928005\"><\/media-item><media-item class=\"zoomable\" freeform-scale=\"20\" freeform-x=\"31.54540760839714\" freeform-y=\"5.922268238292449\" freeform-z=\"19\" hash=\"U2736007924352019055289854995781\"><\/media-item><media-item class=\"zoomable\" freeform-scale=\"20\" freeform-x=\"14.436236007513923\" freeform-y=\"6.555019718557413\" freeform-z=\"5\" hash=\"R2736007924112211382331630824773\"><\/media-item><media-item class=\"zoomable\" freeform-scale=\"20\" freeform-x=\"46.778185453307124\" freeform-y=\"7.047159758763498\" freeform-z=\"20\" hash=\"R2736007924370465799363564547397\"><\/media-item><media-item class=\"zoomable\" freeform-scale=\"20\" freeform-x=\"58.981226175698396\" freeform-y=\"9.603047313552528\" freeform-z=\"10\" hash=\"T2736007924315125567142435892549\"><\/media-item><media-item class=\"zoomable\" freeform-scale=\"20\" freeform-x=\"11.546725840647694\" freeform-y=\"13.96634113653591\" freeform-z=\"14\" hash=\"M2736007924130658126405340376389\"><\/media-item><media-item class=\"zoomable\" freeform-scale=\"43.89\" freeform-x=\"27.45839329459197\" freeform-y=\"16.186903362590765\" freeform-z=\"12\" hash=\"I2736007924038424406036792618309\" scale=\"43.89\"><\/media-item><media-item class=\"zoomable\" freeform-scale=\"20\" freeform-x=\"66.67640693829573\" freeform-y=\"20.851962518263008\" freeform-z=\"13\" hash=\"D2736007924259785334921307237701\"><\/media-item><media-item class=\"zoomable\" freeform-scale=\"20\" freeform-x=\"12.00041744021267\" freeform-y=\"24.301281980863678\" freeform-z=\"15\" hash=\"L2736007924056871150110502169925\"><\/media-item><media-item class=\"zoomable\" freeform-scale=\"20\" freeform-x=\"78.59256736716065\" freeform-y=\"30.781656798233573\" freeform-z=\"8\" hash=\"C2736007924167551614552759479621\"><\/media-item><media-item class=\"zoomable\" freeform-scale=\"20\" freeform-x=\"61.16899737452075\" freeform-y=\"32.10087772297349\" freeform-z=\"18\" hash=\"M2736007924296678823068726340933\"><\/media-item><media-item class=\"zoomable\" freeform-scale=\"20\" freeform-x=\"5.839713943601629\" freeform-y=\"32.17947732091267\" freeform-z=\"4\" hash=\"E2736007924278232078995016789317\"><\/media-item><media-item class=\"zoomable\" freeform-scale=\"20\" freeform-x=\"19.014401687337276\" freeform-y=\"37.394733662159055\" freeform-z=\"16\" hash=\"I2736007924093764638257921273157\"><\/media-item><media-item class=\"zoomable\" freeform-scale=\"20\" freeform-x=\"37.266370796761535\" freeform-y=\"40.070305720029445\" freeform-z=\"17\" hash=\"T2736007924241338590847597686085\"><\/media-item><media-item class=\"zoomable\" freeform-scale=\"20\" freeform-x=\"54.390811921213654\" freeform-y=\"40.87299930792807\" freeform-z=\"7\" hash=\"Y2736007924204445102700178582853\"><\/media-item><media-item class=\"zoomable\" freeform-scale=\"20\" freeform-x=\"64.99868176774945\" freeform-y=\"41.55501971855742\" freeform-z=\"1\" hash=\"H2736007924222891846773888134469\"><\/media-item><media-item class=\"zoomable\" freeform-scale=\"20\" freeform-x=\"9.851094682031391\" freeform-y=\"42